		(descr "Choc V2 PCB screw-in stabilizer 2u (Yushakobo A050001-01-1), wire at -Y (back). Pivot +-11.9 and hole positions from Salicylic-acid3 Choc_v2_PCBMountStab_2u (measured from the real part). Round NPTH: screw 3.0 at +6.2, claw 4.0 at -8.24 (tight side: can be reamed after fab; the project keeps a copper-free ring r 2.6 around them). Housing box is cut on Edge.Cuts by the project (not in this footprint). Courtyard F: the stabilizer body (seller's drawing, length 18.75) + 0.25. Courtyard B (below the board): box 5.80 x 7.30, screw head d3.85 (larger reading of 3.7-3.85) at +6.2 and the claw (hole d4.0 at -8.24, tip to -10.95) + 0.25. Values: foundry/mech.py CHOC_V2_STAB_HOLES")
